 "text": "Recorder - MORGAN COUNTY, MISSOURI\nMORGAN COUNTY, MISSOURI\nHome\nOffices\nHistory\nCARES Act\nRecorder\n​\n​Nancy Boles\nMarriage License\nMilitary DD2-14 Discharge Records\nRecorder FAQ's\nRecording Fees\n​\nMissouri State Standards for Formatting\n|\n​Responsibilities of the Recorder:\nRecord and maintain records pertaining to real property\nIssue and maintain Marriage License Information\nFile and maintain federal and state tax liens\nFile and maintain military discharges (Request Form)\n|\nCourthouse Hours ​\nMonday through Friday\n8:00 am to 4:30 pm\nWould you like to...\nPay Taxes\nSearch online taxes and print receipts\nMorgan County GIS Map\nGet Weather Alerts\n​​\n|\n​ Closed New Year's Day\nMartin Luther King Day\nPresidents Day\nGood Friday\nMemorial Day\nIndependence Day\nLabor Day\nColumbus Day\nVeteran's Day\nThanksgiving Day\nThanksgiving Friday\nChristmas Eve\nChristmas Day\n|\n​ Locations\nCourthouse\n​100 E. Newton Versailles, MO 65084\n​Justice Center\n211 E. Newton Versailles, MO 65084\n|\nHome\nOffices\nHistory\nCARES Act",
